From: AlessandroRCL <alessandro.1901.ramiro@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:32:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(monitoring): add locations and Water Points catalog
 with plan limit (US13)

Locations group the Water Points of a premises or home. The number of Water Points
is limited by the plan in force through PlanEntitlementProvider. Assigning a device
now requires a Water Point of the same account, devices and readings can be filtered
by location, and devices can be retrieved or unlinked by id.
